{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-14",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "宁扣工资也要重提魅力远航  (Forfeiting a Month's Pay to Defend Originals)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xie_ling": "谢灵",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Losing his temper in the boardroom, Xie Ling breaks his own gag rule by invoking Chun Yuqiao's name, giving Bu Xiaogu the opening she needs to defend Xingtian's original shows. Listen to their Mandarin showdown first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "在这个房间里除了我谢灵，谁有本事再现当年淳于乔那会儿的收视率？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长刚刚公布过规则，不提前朝旧事，您这个月工资扣了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "感谢大家给我这个讲话的机会，我熟悉本土原创节目的制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "雷总，请把我这个月的工资也扣了，因为我不得不讲一讲前朝旧事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "魅力远航因为延播，我一直在做跟踪研究。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "预告片播出以后，已经有六家卫视确定要制作同类型的节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "大家都说，一部还没有播出的电视节目，拯救了电视的开机率。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你的意思就是说，这一切功劳和数据，都是你们魅力远航引起的呗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "反正不是因为引进版节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我认为即使公司重视引进内容，也不应该停止原创，反而该把收益投入原创。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "就是说用我节目赚的钱来养你的原创节目是吧？你也太天真了吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这话得等您那节目真正挣了钱再说。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "在这个房间里除了我谢灵，谁有本事再现当年淳于乔那会儿的收视率？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In this room besides me, Xie Ling, who has the skill to match the ratings from Chun Yuqiao's era?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长刚刚公布过规则，不提前朝旧事，您这个月工资扣了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The chairwoman just announced the rule against mentioning the former era, so your month's salary is docked.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "感谢大家给我这个讲话的机会，我熟悉本土原创节目的制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you all for this chance to speak; domestic original production is what I know well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "雷总，请把我这个月的工资也扣了，因为我不得不讲一讲前朝旧事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director Lei, please dock my month's salary too, because I have no choice except to speak of the former era.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "魅力远航因为延播，我一直在做跟踪研究。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because Charming Voyage was delayed, I have been conducting continuous follow-up research on it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "预告片播出以后，已经有六家卫视确定要制作同类型的节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After the trailer aired, six satellite networks committed to producing programmes of the same genre.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "大家都说，一部还没有播出的电视节目，拯救了电视的开机率。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone online said that a television show yet to air had single-handedly rescued television turn-on rates.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你的意思就是说，这一切功劳和数据，都是你们魅力远航引起的呗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So you mean to claim all that credit and data were sparked solely by your Charming Voyage?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "反正不是因为引进版节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'At any rate, it was not sparked by imported format remakes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我认为即使公司重视引进内容，也不应该停止原创，反而该把收益投入原创。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even if the company values imported content, we must not halt originals; instead, remake profits should fund originals.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "就是说用我节目赚的钱来养你的原创节目是吧？你也太天真了吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Meaning use money earned by my shows to subsidize your originals, right? How naive can you get!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这话得等您那节目真正挣了钱再说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Save that talk until your programmes have actually earned money first.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "在这个房间里除了我谢灵，谁有本事再现当年淳于乔那会儿的收视率？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长刚刚公布过规则，不提前朝旧事，您这个月工资扣了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "感谢大家给我这个讲话的机会，我熟悉本土原创节目的制作。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "雷总，请把我这个月的工资也扣了，因为我不得不讲一讲前朝旧事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "魅力远航因为延播，我一直在做跟踪研究。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "预告片播出以后，已经有六家卫视确定要制作同类型的节目。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "大家都说，一部还没有播出的电视节目，拯救了电视的开机率。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你的意思就是说，这一切功劳和数据，都是你们魅力远航引起的呗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "反正不是因为引进版节目。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我认为即使公司重视引进内容，也不应该停止原创，反而该把收益投入原创。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "就是说用我节目赚的钱来养你的原创节目是吧？你也太天真了吧！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这话得等您那节目真正挣了钱再说。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Impressed by Xiaogu's research showing how Charming Voyage galvanized original television nationwide, the chairwoman refuses to freeze Xingtian's domestic originals. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
